{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_honebill", "label": "HoneBill", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "HoneBill", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Early-development product. The description, branding, and mobile UI are being redefined, so the README may change. The app identity is now HoneBill. The status section says the remaining old names are the API host pijin-api.vercel.app and the packages/pijin_core package. Licensed MIT."}, {"id": "readme_mobile_app", "label": "apps/mobile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Expo and React Native app, an npm workspace, on Expo SDK 57 and React Native 0.86. Frontend-only for now: no backend calls and no .env. App.tsx is the navigation root. The UI is being rebuilt from scratch. Live src/context/AuthContext is an in-memory mock. Live src/services holds errorReporting only. src/_legacy is read-only old mobile logic. Start it with npx expo start -c from apps/mobile. The repo requires Node 22."}, {"id": "readme_nestjs_backend", "label": "apps/backend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NestJS backend being rebuilt from the old Next.js app. The layout table says it is not scaffolded yet. The file tree says it is created in Phase 1 of the rebuild. Progress and setup are in the NestJS migration plan. The old Next.js app is not part of the workspace and is not meant to be run."}, {"id": "readme_soroban_contracts", "label": "contracts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Soroban smart contract written in Rust. Source lives under contracts/src, including lib.rs and test.rs."}, {"id": "readme_pijin_core", "label": "pijin_core package", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "npm workspace at packages/pijin_core. Shared TypeScript described as the generated contract client for the Soroban contract. It is one of the old names still in use after the HoneBill rename."}, {"id": "readme_docs", "label": "docs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Project notes and rebuild plans. docs/ui-rebuild holds mobile UI plans 01 through 04. docs/backend-rebuild/01-nestjs-migration-plan.md is the NestJS migration plan and progress tracker."}, {"id": "readme_node_22", "label": "Node 22", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Getting started", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Node version the repository requires, because it is the version CI uses. Install dependencies with npm ci at the repo root."}, {"id": "readme_nestjs_migration_plan", "label": "NestJS migration plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Getting started", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "docs/backend-rebuild/01-nestjs-migration-plan.md tracks setup and which endpoints are done for the move from Next.js to NestJS."}, {"id": "readme_legacy_reference_rules", "label": "_legacy reference-only rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "About the `_legacy` folders", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both _legacy folders are reference only. Do not edit, fix, refactor, or delete them, and do not import from them. Copy what is needed into live code. They are not built, type-checked, or tested. apps/mobile/src/_legacy is excluded from tsconfig.json, and apps/_legacy/backend is not an npm workspace. The mobile tree is the old API client, storage, Stellar, and auth, used when wiring real logic into the new UI. The backend tree is the old Next.js app, used when porting each endpoint to NestJS."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "readme_mobile_app", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "readme_nestjs_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "apps_legacy_backend_legacy_nextjs_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "readme_soroban_contracts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "readme_pijin_core", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "readme_docs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "Repository layout", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_honebill", "target": "docs_ui_rebuild_01_parity_and_extraction_map_legacy_ui_v1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "so